# Fractal Tender: "if you put a counter on this creature this turn" - a counter Bot1 puts on its Ornithopter (Growth Curve) is a
# counter on another creature (CR 122.6), so no Fractal at the end step; Growth Curve's two mana is not more than the Tender's
# power or toughness, so increment gives it no counter either.

